---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Navigation from '../components/Navigation.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="PCLAF — Tecnología sin vueltas" description="Soporte técnico y diseño web en Floresta. Soluciones claras para que tu tecnología vuelva a funcionar.">
  <Navigation />
  <main class="home-shell">
    <section class="hero-section">
      <div class="hero-topline"><span class="eyebrow">PCLAF / FLORESTA, CABA</span><span class="hero-status"><i></i> Estamos atendiendo</span></div>
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy"><p class="kicker">Tu tecnología, en buenas manos.</p><h1>Que funcione.<br /><em>Y que se note.</em></h1><p class="hero-lede">Reparamos tu equipo, aceleramos tu negocio y traducimos lo complejo a algo que podés entender.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/turnos.html">Reservar un turno <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#servicios">Ver qué hacemos <span>↓</span></a></div></div>
        <div class="hero-art" aria-label="Ilustración abstracta de tecnología en movimiento"><div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="core"><span>PC</span><b>LAF</b></div><div class="float-card card-a"><small>DIAGNÓSTICO</small><strong>Claro y honesto</strong></div><div class="float-card card-b"><small>RESPUESTA</small><strong>En el día</strong></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-foot"><span>Scroll para explorar</span><span class="line"></span><span>01 — 04</span></div>
    </section>
    <section class="statement-section"><p class="section-label">Una forma distinta de resolver</p><div class="statement"><h2>No te hablamos en técnico.<br /><span>Te hablamos claro.</span></h2><p>Desde una notebook que no arranca hasta la web que tu proyecto necesita. Escuchamos el problema, encontramos la solución y te acompañamos en el camino.</p></div></section>
    <section class="services-section" id="servicios"><div class="section-heading"><p class="section-label">Dos caminos. Una misma obsesión.</p><h2>Hacemos que<br /><span>avance.</span></h2></div><div class="service-list"><a class="service-row repair" href="/service-tecnico-pc-flores-floresta.html"><span class="service-index">01</span><div><h3>Soporte técnico</h3><p>Diagnóstico, reparación y puesta a punto para PC, notebook y equipos gamer.</p></div><span class="service-arrow">↗</span></a><a class="service-row web" href="/diseno-web.html"><span class="service-index">02</span><div><h3>Diseño web</h3><p>Sitios con personalidad que convierten visitas en oportunidades reales.</p></div><span class="service-arrow">↗</span></a></div></section>
    <section class="proof-section"><div><p class="section-label">La diferencia está en el proceso</p><h2>Simple para vos.<br /><span>Preciso por dentro.</span></h2></div><div class="proof-items"><div><strong>01</strong><p>Te escuchamos</p><small>Antes de tocar nada, entendemos qué necesitás.</small></div><div><strong>02</strong><p>Te explicamos</p><small>Sin sorpresas, sin palabras raras, sin letra chica.</small></div><div><strong>03</strong><p>Lo resolvemos</p><small>Con oficio, criterio y atención de verdad.</small></div></div></section>
    <section class="cta-section"><p class="section-label">¿Listo para dejarlo atrás?</p><h2>Tu próximo paso<br /><em>empieza acá.</em></h2><a class="button button-primary" href="/turnos.html">Reservar mi turno <span>↗</span></a></section>
  </main>
  <footer class="site-footer"><span>PCLAF — Tecnología sin vueltas.</span><span>Campana 51, Floresta, CABA</span><a href="https://wa.me/5491135708345">WhatsApp ↗</a></footer>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
:global(html){scroll-behavior:smooth}:global(body){margin:0;background:#111;color:#f6f3ed;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}:global(a){transition:all .25s ease}.home-shell{overflow:hidden;background:#111}.hero-section,.statement-section,.services-section,.proof-section,.cta-section{max-width:1240px;margin:auto;padding-left:clamp(24px,5vw,76px);padding-right:clamp(24px,5vw,76px)}.hero-section{min-height:calc(100vh - 76px);padding-top:42px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.hero-topline,.hero-foot{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;color:#a9a59e;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em}.eyebrow{color:#ff5a36}.hero-status{margin-left:auto}.hero-status i{display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;margin-right:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#78d99a;box-shadow:0 0 0 5px #78d99a22}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;align-items:center;flex:1;gap:40px}.kicker,.section-label{color:#ff5a36;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;font-weight:700}.hero-copy h1{font-size:clamp(58px,9vw,128px);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.08em;margin:22px 0 32px;font-weight:800}.hero-copy h1 em,.cta-section h2 em{color:#ff5a36;font-style:normal}.hero-lede{max-width:430px;color:#b9b5ad;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55}.hero-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;margin-top:42px}.button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:25px;padding:16px 20px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none!important;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}.button-primary{background:#ff5a36;color:#111!important}.button-primary:hover{background:#ff785a;transform:translateY(-3px)}.button span{font-size:19px}.text-link{color:#f6f3ed;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px}.text-link span{color:#ff5a36;margin-left:10px}.hero-art{height:480px;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center}.orbit{position:absolute;border:1px solid #45413b;border-radius:50%;transform:rotate(-28deg)}.orbit-one{width:78%;height:45%;}.orbit-two{width:55%;height:85%;transform:rotate(55deg);border-color:#ff5a3677}.core{position:relative;width:170px;height:170px;background:#ff5a36;color:#111;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-content:center;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 0 0 14px #ff5a361c,0 0 80px #ff5a3640;animation:pulse 4s ease-in-out infinite}.core span{font-size:37px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.12em}.core b{font-size:17px;letter-spacing:.3em;margin-left:8px}.float-card{position:absolute;padding:15px 17px;background:#1d1d1b;border:1px solid #3d3934;box-shadow:0 20px 35px #0005;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;animation:float 5s ease-in-out infinite}.float-card small{color:#ff5a36;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.14em}.float-card strong{font-size:13px}.card-a{top:20%;left:8%}.card-b{right:5%;bottom:16%;animation-delay:1.5s}.hero-foot{padding:20px 0 30px}.hero-foot .line{height:1px;flex:1;background:#45413b}.statement-section{padding-top:150px;padding-bottom:160px}.statement{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:80px;align-items:end}.statement h2,.services-section h2,.proof-section h2{font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,78px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.07em;margin:28px 0 0}.statement h2 span,.services-section h2 span,.proof-section h2 span{color:#827c73}.statement p{color:#b9b5ad;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;max-width:390px}.services-section{padding-top:100px;padding-bottom:150px;border-top:1px solid #35322d}.section-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;margin-bottom:65px}.service-list{border-top:1px solid #45413b}.service-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:90px 1fr 60px;align-items:center;gap:25px;padding:31px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #45413b;text-decoration:none!important}.service-row:hover{padding-left:16px}.service-row h3{font-size:clamp(27px,4vw,48px);letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:0 0 9px;color:#f6f3ed}.service-row p{margin:0;color:#a9a59e;font-size:14px}.service-index{color:#ff5a36;font:12px monospace}.service-arrow{justify-self:end;font-size:28px;color:#ff5a36}.proof-section{padding-top:125px;padding-bottom:150px;background:#f6f3ed;color:#111;max-width:none;padding-left:max(clamp(24px,5vw,76px),calc((100vw - 1088px)/2));padding-right:max(clamp(24px,5vw,76px),calc((100vw - 1088px)/2));display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:80px}.proof-section .section-label{color:#ff5a36}.proof-section h2 span{color:#827c73}.proof-items{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:25px}.proof-items div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:50px 1fr;column-gap:18px;border-bottom:1px solid #d4d0c8;padding-bottom:21px}.proof-items strong{grid-row:span 2;color:#ff5a36;font:13px monospace}.proof-items p{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:18px;font-weight:700}.proof-items small{color:#68645d;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4}.cta-section{padding-top:160px;padding-bottom:160px}.cta-section h2{font-size:clamp(54px,9vw,120px);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.08em;margin:30px 0 46px}.site-footer{border-top:1px solid #35322d;padding:27px max(24px,5vw);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;color:#827c73;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em}.site-footer a{color:#ff5a36;text-decoration:none}@keyframes pulse{50%{transform:scale(1.05);box-shadow:0 0 0 24px #ff5a3610,0 0 110px #ff5a3655}}@keyframes float{50%{transform:translateY(-12px)}}@media(max-width:760px){.hero-section{min-height:auto;padding-top:32px}.hero-grid,.statement,.proof-section{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:35px}.hero-copy h1{font-size:clamp(64px,18vw,100px);margin-top:18px}.hero-art{height:340px}.float-card{transform:scale(.85)}.statement-section,.services-section,.proof-section,.cta-section{padding-top:95px;padding-bottom:95px}.section-heading{display:block;margin-bottom:40px}.service-row{grid-template-columns:38px 1fr 28px;gap:10px}.service-row p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.4}.proof-section{padding-left:24px;padding-right:24px}.site-footer{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}}
</style>
